  "focusRing": {
    "$source": "Menu Item > Ring — node I923:25890;851:22778",
    "$note": "The keyboard-focus ring shared across interactive components. In Figma it is a full-size overlay frame (size-full over the parent's bounds) with a 2px border, so its OUTER edge aligns with the component's own outer edge rather than sitting outside it. Reproduced in CSS with a negative outline-offset equal to the ring width.",
